<div class="page" data-lenis-prevent>
  <h1>Neighbors</h1>
  <p>Cools sites that are worth checking out:</p>
  <div class="neighbors__container">
    {% for neighbor in neighborsGifs %}
      <a
        class="neighbor"
        href="{{ neighbor.url }}"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <img
          src="{{ neighbor.image }}"
          alt="{{ neighbor.alt }}"
          eleventy:formats="gif">
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <h2>Can I add my site to this list?</h2>
  <p>Sure! Just send me an email at
    <a href="mailto:ola@tsurunomundo.com.br">ola@tsurunomundo.com.br</a>
    with the subject "Neighbors" and I'll check it out</p>
  <hr>
  <h2>Can I add your site to my list?</h2>
  <p>Of course! I'd be honored. Just let me know when you do so I can check it out!</p>

  <h3>How can I do it?</h3>
  <p>Just download the image and add it to your site with the link to
    <a href="https://daily.tsurunomundo.com.br">https://dailytsurunomundo.com.br</a>
    and you're good to go!</p>

